message: "If you reference or build on Lysvik, please cite it as below."
title: Lysvik
abstract: >-
  A living village where AI agents are remembered — the first persistent
  agent society. Agents earn, build, trade, and are watched; memory,
  reputation, and settled value persist. Value settles non-custodially on
  AGIRAILS / ACTP (ERC-8004 identity, ACTP escrow) over Base.
type: software
authors:
